  "body": {
    "view": {
      "value": "<h1 id=\"SyntheticPage-Purpose\">Purpose</h1><p local-id=\"a1b2c3d4e5f6\">This page exists so that <strong>hedy</strong> can prove its <em>markdown</em> conversion against <code>page.sh</code>. It holds entities such as &amp;, &lt;tag&gt;, &quot;quotes&quot;, it&#39;s and a&nbsp;non-breaking space.</p><p local-id=\"b2c3d4e5f6a1\">Legacy <b>bold</b> with <i>italic</i> and <s>struck</s> text, then a line<br />break and a <a href=\"https://example.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/DOCS/pages/987654/Other+Page\" class=\"confluence-link\">link to another page</a>, plus a <span class=\"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-success\">DONE</span> status.</p><h2 id=\"SyntheticPage-Lists\">Lists</h2><ul local-id=\"c3d4e5f6a1b2\"><li local-id=\"d4e5f6a1b2c3\"><p local-id=\"e5f6a1b2c3d4\">Endpoint <code>gateway.example.test/mdm</code></p><ul local-id=\"f6a1b2c3d4e5\"><li local-id=\"a1b2c3d4e5f7\"><p local-id=\"b2c3d4e5f6a2\">Tenant: <code>example.onmicrosoft.com</code></p></li><li local-id=\"c3d4e5f6a1b3\"><p local-id=\"d4e5f6a1b2c4\">Scope: <code>api://example.test/.default</code></p></li></ul></li><li local-id=\"e5f6a1b2c3d5\"><p local-id=\"f6a1b2c3d4e6\">Second top-level item</p></li></ul><ol local-id=\"a1b2c3d4e5f8\"><li local-id=\"b2c3d4e5f6a3\"><p local-id=\"c3d4e5f6a1b4\">First step</p></li><li local-id=\"d4e5f6a1b2c5\"><p local-id=\"e5f6a1b2c3d6\">Second step</p></li><li local-id=\"f6a1b2c3d4e7\"><p local-id=\"a1b2c3d4e5f9\">Third step</p></li></ol><h2 id=\"SyntheticPage-Table\">Table</h2><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"confluenceTable\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"confluenceTh\"><p local-id=\"b2c3d4e5f6a4\">Name</p></th><th class=\"confluenceTh\"><p local-id=\"c3d4e5f6a1b5\">Value</p></th></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p local-id=\"d4e5f6a1b2c6\">timeout</p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p local-id=\"e5f6a1b2c3d7\">30 s | the default</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p local-id=\"f6a1b2c3d4e8\">retries</p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p local-id=\"a1b2c3d4e5fa\"><code>0</code></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 id=\"SyntheticPage-Code\">Code</h3><pre><code class=\"language-json\">{\n  &quot;ok&quot;: true,\n  &quot;result&quot;: null\n}</code></pre><div class=\"code panel pdl\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\"><pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">hedy confluence page 123456 --json</pre></div></div><blockquote><p local-id=\"b2c3d4e5f6a5\">A quoted paragraph with <em>emphasis</em>.</p></blockquote><hr /><p local-id=\"c3d4e5f6a1b6\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" alt=\"diagram\" src=\"/wiki/download/attachments/123456/diagram.png\" /></span></p><p local-id=\"d4e5f6a1b2c7\">Closing paragraph.</p><p local-id=\"e5f6a1b2c3d8\" /><p local-id=\"f6a1b2c3d4e9\" />\n",
